## Schema

### Required

- `name` (String) Name of the copy. Changing it replaces the copy.
- `snapshot_id` (String) `tenant_snapshots` key that must belong to `tenant_id`. The copy is still the current tenant. Changing it replaces the copy. The snapshot row is not modified.
- `tenant_id` (String) Source tenant key, the same value as `vergeio_tenant.id`. Changing it replaces the copy. This tenant is not modified.

### Optional

- `isolate` (Boolean) Post `isolateon` on the copy when it is not already isolated. Defaults to true. false leaves the connectivity the clone copied. This resource does not post `isolateoff`.

### Read-Only

- `id` (String) Tenant key of the copy.
- `snapshot_name` (String) Name of `snapshot_id` at create.

## Import

Import with the tenant key of the copy.

```shell
terraform import vergeio_tenant_copy.example 40
```

